name ctex
category Package
revision 79993
shortdesc LaTeX classes and packages for Chinese typesetting
longdesc ctex is a bundle of LaTeX classes and packages for typesetting
longdesc documents in Chinese. It works with the (pdf)LaTeX, XeLaTeX and
longdesc LuaLaTeX engines, supports GB2312 / UTF-8 / Unicode input,
longdesc integrates Chinese punctuation kerning, multi-engine font
longdesc configuration, and provides Chinese-style section heading
longdesc commands for the standard article / book / report classes.
